### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

###

### Get All Tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

###

### Get Task by ID (ID: 1)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/1

###

### Get Task by ID (ID: 999 - Not Found)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/999

###

### Create New Task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Node.js",
  "description": "Study Node.js and Express"
}

###

### Create Task with Missing Title (Error)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This should fail"
}

###

### Update Task (Complete it)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

###

### Update Task (Change title and description)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated: Build Task API",
  "description": "Create REST endpoints for tasks with proper error handling"
}

###

### Update Task (Invalid completed field)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": "yes"
}

###

### Update Non-existent Task (404 Error)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "This task does not exist"
}

###

### Delete Task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/3

###

### Delete Non-existent Task (404 Error)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/999

###

### Test Invalid Route (404 Error)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/invalid-endpoint
